1620..1692 Comment "/// A field whose variable the body does not take: `q` is a metavariable"
1693..1768 Comment "/// written without `x` as an argument, so no instance of it names `x`, and"
1769..1843 Comment "/// the law needs no freshness condition where an abstraction\'s atom would"
1844..1920 Comment "/// (`freshness.gandr`): a field binds for substitution, never for swapping."
